      "title": "Face attention — reference only",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "The CPU-only node detects the largest reference face and boosts only an internal oval. It excludes the hair/head silhouette, ears, neck, clothing, body, and source background. This MASK controls reference attention inside Krea2EditModelPatch; it never masks, composites, inpaints, or sharpens output pixels. Defaults reproduce the accepted no-Mitch-LoRA test."
